# Test inputs and baselines must reach the working tree byte for byte on every
# platform: several tests exercise line-ending handling (LF, CRLF, mixed) and
# the GNATformatOnDiskDriver test driver compares formatted files exactly with
# their baselines, so Git must never convert their line endings (e.g. with
# core.autocrlf on Windows).
testsuite/tests/** -text
